{"id":"C797c38ed3f379841bba2","zh":"整体坐标系","en":"global coordinate system","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","definition_zh":"描述各子系统及轮轨耦合关系的统一参考系。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"整体坐标系为车辆、轨道及隧道等对象提供统一的空间参照，用于表达轮轨位置和列车运行位置，并在轮轨耦合建模中构建耦合矩阵，使各对象的位置与耦合关系能够统一描述。","translation_note":"本词条含依据文献语境拟定的参考译名。","usage_variants":[{"id":"C797c38ed3f379841bba2","zh":"整体坐标系","en":"global coordinate system","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"H19287ee85a8815543ad3","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学 · Pan等（2026）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D5ed414a6960bbf4bfb1c","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"整体坐标系"},{"id":"D5b47973f28bde10824ac","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"global coordinate system"}],"sources":{"P098":{"id":"P098","title":"Vehicle-track interaction considering wheelset flexibility: Influence of the wheelset flexibility","authors":"L Pan, L Xu","year":"2026","doi":"10.1177/10775463241305696","journal_citation":"Journal of Vibration and Control 32 (7-8), 1864-1878","label":"Pan等（2026）","overview_slug":"2026-vehicle-track-interaction-considering-wheelset-flexibility-influence-of-the-wheelset-flexibility"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S0d0ad6d611738a8b705b","source_id":"P098","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"In the terms of wheel-rail relationship, a method based on virtual degree of freedom method is proposed, and the wheel-rail coupling matrices are formed in the global coordinate system to avoid the complicated coordinate transformation.","citations":[{"source_id":"P098","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C3a2b621e0a810b9c586a","target_concept_id":"C3a2b621e0a810b9c586a","target_zh":"虚拟自由度法","target_en":"virtual degree of freedom method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cca1f1154aa8474836b1a","target_concept_id":"Cca1f1154aa8474836b1a","target_zh":"轮轨耦合矩阵","target_en":"wheel-rail coupling matrices","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf3d6cf92d1e6f3238a9d","target_concept_id":"Cf3d6cf9